  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 4 of HTTP COOKIES & WEB AUTH. Your session cookie is one missing attribute away from being someone else's. This field manual walks every `Set-Cookie` attribute, why `Path` silently eats your login, how a compromised subdomain can overwrite a cookie it should never touch, and where SameSite actually stops CSRF versus where it just looks like it does. Ends with the session-vs-JWT table and a ship checklist you can paste into your auth PR.",
